Eph 4:1 , He exhorts to unity;
Eph 4:7 , and declares that God therefore gives divers gifts unto men;
Eph 4:11 , that his church might be edified
Eph 4:16 . and grow up in Christ;
Eph 4:18 , He calls them from the impurity of the Gentiles;
Eph 4:24 , to put on the new man;
Eph 4:25 , to cast off lying;
Eph 4:29 , and corrupt communication.
